	%A key distinction of our method is its guaranteed reliability and conservatism. In the context of specular light transport, the metrics are the variance of the sampling process and the error in the root-finding step \cite{jakob2012manifold, zeltner2020specular}. We aim to sample specular paths with bounded sampling variance and root-finding error. 
