\subsubsection{Parameter sensitivity of $\alg$}

 To evaluate the sensitivity of $\alg$ to the leftover fraction $\bw$, we varied $\bw$ within the set $\{0.01, 0.05, 0.15, 0.1, 0.2\}$. The results are shown in \cref{fig:bucketthresh}. The results are presented in \cref{fig:bucketthresh}, where the x-axis shows the $(\lo\%, \hi\%)$ pair, and the y-axis displays the AUROC. For each pair, we adjusted the bucket fraction and measured the performance of $\alg$ on both \deepseek{} and \gemma{}. The results suggest that $\alg$ exhibits low sensitivity to the choice of bucket thresholds.

